---
version: 2.0.2
title: visual editor blocks de
---
<form class="visual-editor" hx-post="/editor/visual/update" hx-swap="none" hx-sync="this:queue all" hx-trigger="input delay:300ms, flush" id="visual-form"><div class="ui-alert ui-alert--info" role="status"><p class="ui-alert__title">Bearbeiten hier überschreiben das YAML</p><div class="ui-alert__body">Die erste Änderung in diesem Modus generiert das YAML in einheitlicher Form neu; Kommentare und eigene Formatierungen gehen verloren.</div></div><fieldset class="ui-block"><legend class="ui-block__title">Stil</legend><div class="ui-block__body"><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Design</span><select class="ui-field__input" name="style.theme"><option value>Classic</option><option selected value="minimal">Minimal</option><option value="studio">Studio</option><option value="spotlight">Spotlight</option><option value="cover">Cover</option></select></label><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Akzentfarbe</span><select class="ui-field__input" name="style.color"><option value="black">Schwarz</option><option selected value>Blau</option><option value="burgundy">Bordeaux</option><option value="green">Grün</option><option value="grey">Grau</option><option value="orange">Orange</option><option value="purple">Lila</option><option value="red">Rot</option></select></label><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Papierformat</span><select class="ui-field__input" name="style.paper"><option selected value>A4</option><option value="letter">US Letter</option></select></label><div class="ui-field"><div class="ui-field__head"><label class="ui-field__label" for="field-language">Sprache</label><button aria-label="Erläuterung zu „Sprache“" class="ui-field__info" popovertarget="field-language-info" title="Erläuterung zu „Sprache“" type="button">i</button></div><input class="ui-field__input" id="field-language" name="language" type="text" value="de"><div class="ui-field__popover" id="field-language-info" popover><p>Die Sprache des Lebenslaufs als Code aus zwei Buchstaben, etwa en oder de; en, wenn leer. Sie legt die Sprache des PDFs für Bewerbermanagement-Software, Silbentrennung und Anführungszeichen fest.</p><button class="ui-button ui-button--secondary" popovertarget="field-language-info" popovertargetaction="hide" type="button">Schließen</button></div></div></div></fieldset><fieldset class="ui-block"><legend class="ui-block__title">Person</legend><div class="ui-block__body"><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Name<span class="ui-field__required"> (Pflichtfeld)</span></span><input aria-required="true" class="ui-field__input" name="person.name" type="text" value="Jane &lt;Roe&gt;"></label><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Tätigkeit</span><input class="ui-field__input" name="person.title" type="text" value></label><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Adresse</span><input class="ui-field__input" name="person.address" type="text" value></label><div aria-label="Foto" class="ui-field" data-photo-failed-label="Das Foto konnte nicht gelesen werden. Bitte ein JPEG- oder PNG-Bild wählen." data-photo-field role="group"><span class="ui-field__label">Foto</span><div class="ui-field__photo"><img alt class="ui-field__thumbnail" data-photo-thumbnail hidden><input data-photo-value name="person.photo" type="hidden" value><input accept="image/jpeg,image/png" data-photo-input hidden type="file"><button class="ui-button ui-button--secondary" data-change-label="Ändern…" data-choose-label="Auswählen…" data-photo-choose type="button">Auswählen…</button><button class="ui-button ui-button--quiet" data-photo-remove hidden type="button">Entfernen</button></div></div><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Fotozuschnitt</span><select class="ui-field__input" name="style.photo_shape"><option selected value>Rechteck</option><option value="rounded">Abgerundet</option><option value="circle">Kreis</option></select></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="ui-block"><legend class="ui-block__title">Kontakt</legend><div class="ui-block__body"><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">E-Mail</span><input class="ui-field__input" name="contact.email" type="text" value></label><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Telefon</span><input class="ui-field__input" name="contact.phone" type="text" value></label><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Website</span><input class="ui-field__input" name="contact.website" type="text" value></label><div aria-label="Links" class="ui-block-list" role="group"><fieldset class="ui-block"><legend class="ui-block__title">Link 1</legend><div class="ui-block__actions"><div class="visual-editor__move"><button aria-hidden="true" class="ui-button ui-button--quiet" disabled type="button">↑</button><button aria-hidden="true" class="ui-button ui-button--quiet" disabled type="button">↓</button></div><button aria-label="Link 1 entfernen" class="ui-button ui-button--quiet visual-editor__remove" hx-post="/editor/visual/update" hx-swap="outerHTML" hx-sync="closest form:queue all" hx-target="#visual-form" name="op" title="Link 1 entfernen" type="button" value="remove:contact.links.0">Entfernen</button></div><div class="ui-block__body"><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Label<span class="ui-field__required"> (Pflichtfeld)</span></span><input aria-required="true" class="ui-field__input" name="contact.links.0.label" type="text" value="GitHub"></label><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">URL<span class="ui-field__required"> (Pflichtfeld)</span></span><input aria-required="true" class="ui-field__input" name="contact.links.0.url" type="text" value="https://x"></label></div></fieldset><div class="visual-editor__add"><button class="ui-button ui-button--secondary" hx-post="/editor/visual/update" hx-swap="outerHTML" hx-sync="closest form:queue all" hx-target="#visual-form" name="op" type="button" value="add:contact.links">Link hinzufügen</button></div></div></div></fieldset><div aria-label="Abschnitte" class="ui-block-list" role="group"><fieldset class="ui-block"><legend class="ui-block__title">Abschnitt „Datierte Einträge“</legend><div class="ui-block__actions"><div class="visual-editor__move"><button aria-hidden="true" class="ui-button ui-button--quiet" disabled type="button">↑</button><button aria-label="Abschnitt 1 nach unten verschieben" class="ui-button ui-button--quiet" hx-post="/editor/visual/update" hx-swap="outerHTML" hx-sync="closest form:queue all" hx-target="#visual-form" name="op" title="Abschnitt 1 nach unten verschieben" type="button" value="down:sections.0">↓</button></div><button aria-label="Abschnitt 1 entfernen" class="ui-button ui-button--quiet visual-editor__remove" hx-post="/editor/visual/update" hx-swap="outerHTML" hx-sync="closest form:queue all" hx-target="#visual-form" name="op" title="Abschnitt 1 entfernen" type="button" value="remove:sections.0">Entfernen</button></div><div class="ui-block__body"><input name="sections.0.kind" type="hidden" value="entries"><label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-field__label">Name des Abschnitts<span class="ui-field__required"> (Pflichtfeld)</span></span><input aria-required="true" class="ui-field__input" name="sections.0.name" type="text" value="Work"></label><div aria-label="Datierte Einträge" class="ui-block-list" role="group"><fieldset class="ui-block"><legend class="ui-block__title">Datierter Eintrag 1</legend><div class="ui-block__actions"><div class="visual-editor__move"><button aria-hidden="true" class="ui-button ui-button--quiet" disabled type="button">↑</button><button aria-label="Datierter Eintrag 1 nach unten verschieben" class="ui-button ui-button--quiet" hx-post="/editor/visual/update" hx-swap="outerHTML" hx-sync="closest form:queue all" hx-target="#visual-form" name="op" title="Datierter Eintrag 1 nach unten verschieben" type="button" value="down:sections.0.entries.0">↓</button></div><button aria-label="Datierter Eintrag 1 entfernen" class=